IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `qwhs-dates`
IMPORT `qwhs-rules`
IMPORT `qwhs-seat`

-- Work Health and Safety Act 2011 (Qld) -- worked cases for the worker's questions (qwhs-seat.l4), the date helpers
-- (qwhs-dates.l4) and the time limits (qwhs-rules.l4). Every expected value was worked by hand from the deposited text;
-- none was copied from the encoding's output. Each assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about
-- the law. The facts are illustrative.
-- UNOFFICIAL. Based on content from the Queensland Legislation website at 6 November 2026 (c) The State of Queensland,
-- CC BY 4.0. BASELINE ENCODING. Not for public use as advice. See NOTES.md.

§ `cases`

`d` MEANS `the calendar day`
`any day` MEANS `d` 1 1 2000

§§ `Dates`

-- F1: a month count into a shorter month ends on its last day; 29 February plus a year is 28 February.
#ASSERT `the day` 6 `months after` (`d` 31 8 2025) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `the day` 3 `months after` (`d` 30 11 2025) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `the day` 1 `years after` (`d` 29 2 2024) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2025
#ASSERT `the day` 18 `months after` (`d` 15 1 2025) EQUALS `d` 15 7 2026
#ASSERT `the day` 14 `days after` (`d` 1 3 2026) EQUALS `d` 15 3 2026

§§ `Am I a worker: ss 5, 7`

#ASSERT `Am I a worker under the Act` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- s 5(7): a volunteer association does not conduct a business or undertaking.
#ASSERT `Am I a worker under the Act` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I a worker under the Act` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Am I a worker under the Act` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- The person says there is no business or undertaking: a borrowed term the Act does not settle.
#ASSERT `Am I a worker under the Act` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- s 7(2): police officers.
#ASSERT `Am I a worker under the Act` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

