#ASSERT `Until when must the business keep the record of my incident` (`d` 29 2 2024) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2029

-- s 39: JUST TRUE means the duty stops the action.
#ASSERT `Does the duty to leave the site undisturbed stop this action` TRUE FALSE `any other action` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Does the duty to leave the site undisturbed stop this action` TRUE FALSE `to assist an injured person` EQUALS JUST FALSE
