§§ `Penalties: ss 31-34D, 104-109`

`cat 1` MEANS `category 1 -- reckless or negligent conduct exposing me to a risk of death or serious injury or illness`
`cat 2` MEANS `category 2 -- failure to comply with a duty that exposed me to a risk of death or serious injury or illness`
`cat 3` MEANS `category 3 -- failure to comply with a health and safety duty`
`plain individual` MEANS `an individual, not as a person conducting a business or undertaking or as its officer`
`business individual` MEANS `an individual, as a person conducting a business or undertaking or as its officer`

#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `cat 1` `plain individual` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 3000 `units or` 5 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `cat 1` `business individual` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 6000 `units or` 5 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `cat 1` `a body corporate` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 30000 `units or` 0 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `cat 2` `plain individual` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 1500 `units or` 0 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `cat 2` `business individual` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 3000 `units or` 0 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `cat 2` `a body corporate` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 15000 `units or` 0 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `cat 3` `plain individual` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 500 `units or` 0 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `cat 3` `business individual` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 1000 `units or` 0 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `cat 3` `a body corporate` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 5000 `units or` 0 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `industrial manslaughter by the person conducting the business or undertaking` `a body corporate` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 100000 `units or` 0 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `industrial manslaughter by the person conducting the business or undertaking` `business individual` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 0 `units or` 20 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `industrial manslaughter by a senior officer` `plain individual` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 0 `units or` 20 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `industrial manslaughter by a senior officer` `a body corporate` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `not an offence this kind of offender can commit`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `industrial manslaughter by a senior officer` `plain individual` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `no offence by this person (a volunteer)`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `cat 2` `plain individual` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `no offence by this person (a volunteer)`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `cat 2` `plain individual` TRUE TRUE EQUALS `at most` 1500 `units or` 0 `years`
#ASSERT `What is the most the person responsible can face` `discriminatory, coercive or misleading conduct (ss 104, 107, 108, 109)` `a body corporate` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `at most` 1000 `units or` 0 `years`

§§ `s 231: asking for a prosecution`

`cat 1 or 2` MEANS `I reasonably consider the act or omission is a category 1 or category 2 offence`
`IM` MEANS `I reasonably consider the act or omission is an industrial manslaughter offence (Part 2A)`
`coronial` MEANS `a coronial report or inquest shows me it is a category 1 or category 2 offence`

-- Act on 15 January 2025: the window is 15 July 2025 to 15 July 2026.
#ASSERT `Can I ask for a prosecution on this day` `cat 1 or 2` FALSE (`d` 15 1 2025) `any day` (`d` 14 7 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I ask for a prosecution on this day` `cat 1 or 2` FALSE (`d` 15 1 2025) `any day` (`d` 15 7 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I ask for a prosecution on this day` `cat 1 or 2` FALSE (`d` 15 1 2025) `any day` (`d` 15 7 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I ask for a prosecution on this day` `cat 1 or 2` FALSE (`d` 15 1 2025) `any day` (`d` 16 7 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I ask for a prosecution on this day` `cat 1 or 2` TRUE (`d` 15 1 2025) `any day` (`d` 1 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I ask for a prosecution on this day` `IM` FALSE (`d` 15 1 2025) `any day` (`d` 14 7 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I ask for a prosecution on this day` `IM` FALSE (`d` 15 1 2025) `any day` (`d` 15 7 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I ask for a prosecution on this day` `IM` FALSE (`d` 15 1 2025) `any day` (`d` 1 1 2035) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Coronial report on 1 February 2026: until 1 August 2026.
#ASSERT `Can I ask for a prosecution on this day` `coronial` FALSE `any day` (`d` 1 2 2026) (`d` 1 8 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I ask for a prosecution on this day` `coronial` FALSE `any day` (`d` 1 2 2026) (`d` 2 8 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I ask for a prosecution on this day` `none of these` FALSE (`d` 15 1 2025) `any day` (`d` 1 1 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- s 231(2): received 31 August 2025, answer due 30 November 2025.
#ASSERT `By when must the WHS prosecutor answer me` (`d` 31 8 2025) EQUALS `d` 30 11 2025
#ASSERT `By when must the WHS prosecutor answer me` (`d` 30 11 2025) EQUALS `d` 28 2 2026
#ASSERT `Was the WHS prosecutor's answer in time` (`d` 31 8 2025) (`d` 30 11 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Was the WHS prosecutor's answer in time` (`d` 31 8 2025) (`d` 1 12 2025) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Was the WHS prosecutor's answer in time` (`d` 31 8 2025) (`d` 1 9 2025) EQUALS JUST TRUE

