#ASSERT `By when must the DPP advise on my matter` (`d` 15 3 2026) EQUALS `d` 15 4 2026

§§ `s 232: the time to prosecute`

#ASSERT `Until when can the person responsible be prosecuted` `cat 2` (`d` 1 6 2025) FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` EQUALS `proceedings may be taken until` (`d` 1 6 2027)
#ASSERT `Until when can the person responsible be prosecuted` `cat 2` (`d` 1 6 2025) TRUE (`d` 1 9 2026) FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` EQUALS `proceedings may be taken until` (`d` 1 9 2027)
-- The latest period wins even when the coronial year ends first.
#ASSERT `Until when can the person responsible be prosecuted` `cat 2` (`d` 1 6 2025) TRUE (`d` 1 1 2026) FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` EQUALS `proceedings may be taken until` (`d` 1 6 2027)
#ASSERT `Until when can the person responsible be prosecuted` `cat 3` (`d` 1 6 2025) FALSE `any day` TRUE (`d` 1 12 2027) FALSE `any day` EQUALS `proceedings may be taken until` (`d` 1 6 2028)
#ASSERT `Until when can the person responsible be prosecuted` `industrial manslaughter by the person conducting the business or undertaking` (`d` 1 6 2025) FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` EQUALS `no limitation period (industrial manslaughter, s 232(3))`
#ASSERT `Until when can the person responsible be prosecuted` `cat 1` (`d` 1 6 2025) FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` TRUE (`d` 2 6 2027) EQUALS `the limitation period has ended, but fresh evidence lets a category 1 prosecution proceed (s 232(2))` (`d` 1 6 2027)
#ASSERT `Until when can the person responsible be prosecuted` `cat 1` (`d` 1 6 2025) FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` TRUE (`d` 1 6 2027) EQUALS `proceedings may be taken until` (`d` 1 6 2027)
-- s 232(2) is for category 1 only.
#ASSERT `Until when can the person responsible be prosecuted` `cat 2` (`d` 1 6 2025) FALSE `any day` FALSE `any day` TRUE (`d` 2 6 2027) EQUALS `proceedings may be taken until` (`d` 1 6 2027)

